PASS E9a the a0-point has 0 closed-form hits among 52 quantities (each tested as q and q^2); the six decoy points have 0 hits among 312 quantities; expected spurious rate ~ 1.1e-04 per test at this menu size and tolerance
PASS E9b control: a planted value (3/7) pi sqrt3 is recovered by the scan ([('q', '(3/7) pi^1 sqrt3^1 sqrt2^0')]); the same value shifted by 1e-6 (relative) is not
PASS E9c verdict: no quantity of the SdS geometry at the a0-point equals a simple (rational x pi^a sqrt3^b sqrt2^c, p,q <= 40) closed form to 1e-9; every quantity is an explicit algebraic function of Z^2 = 32 pi/3 (e.g. r_b/L = (sqrt(1+32 pi) - 1)/sqrt(96 pi)) with no simplification

